Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,……帮我写一封辞职信，别让老板看出来我恨他……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:20.84,EN,,0,0,0,,...Write my resignation. Don't let my boss see I hate him...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,……他是不是不爱我了，你帮我分析一下他的聊天记录……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:27.88,EN,,0,0,0,,...Does he still love me? Analyze his messages for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:31.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,……我这个月的房租还差两千……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:31.15,EN,,0,0,0,,...I'm two thousand short on this month's rent...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.57,0:00:44.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,……我不想活成我妈妈那样，可我不敢告诉她。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.57,0:00:44.84,EN,,0,0,0,,...I don't want my mother's life, but I can't tell her.
